  "description": "On-device LLM inference for Circle. Alibaba MNN P/Invoke layer with Qwen 3 chat generator. 1.3.5 adds android-arm (32-bit ARMv7) + ios-arm64 (static .a). 7 RIDs total: win-x64, linux-x64, osx-arm64, osx-x64, android-arm64, android-arm, ios-arm64. android-arm: libmnnbridge.so (1.2 MB ELF 32-bit ARM EABI5) + full companion .so set from Alibaba's armeabi-v7a Android MNN. ios-arm64: libmnnbridge.a (34 KB ar archive) + libMNN.a (10 MB, copied from Static/MNN.framework/MNN) — iOS prohibits dynamic library loading from the app sandbox, so the bridge ships as a static library for link-time integration via NativeReference in the consuming MAUI app. CMakeLists.txt iOS branch now respects BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=OFF + uses Static/MNN.framework (with flat Headers/) instead of Dynamic/MNN.framework/Versions/A/Headers. 1.3.4 added osx-x64 + android-arm64 + macOS codesigning.",
